<title>FRANCE: Carrefour gains in defiance of Paris Bourse gloom.</title>
<headline>Carrefour gains in defiance of Paris Bourse gloom.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>French retailer Carrefour defied the generally lower trend in the French stock market, and was the only blue-chip in the afternoon to post a gain.</p>
<p>At 1424 GMT, Carrefour was up 0.90 percent at 3,933 francs.</p>
<p>Dealers said that Carrefour was hardly exposed to the dollar and did not benefit from its rise so far this year, nor from its current slight decline.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
